# Icon-only utility actions

User preference: for secondary / utility controls (refresh, sync, close, retry affordances that sit next to a list or panel title), use a **small icon-only button** — no visible label text.

- Pattern: `h-7 w-7 px-0` secondary button with ~`h-3.5 w-3.5` icon
- Always set `title` and `aria-label` for accessibility
- Place next to the content it acts on (e.g. list title row), not as a lone labeled button floating above the section
- Do not use icon+文案 for these actions unless the user explicitly asks for a labeled CTA
